<!-- ============ HEADER ============ -->
<header class="report-header">
  <h1>ESP32-S3 BLE LVGL 显示屏程序功能说明书</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">穿戴康复外骨骼机械手 — 智能显示屏控制系统</p>
  <p class="meta">
    <span>硬件平台: ESP32-S3</span>|
    <span>UI框架: LVGL v8</span>|
    <span>通信: BLE 5.0 (NimBLE)</span>|
    <span>版本: 1.0</span>|
    <span>日期: 2026-08-05</span>
  </p>
</header>

<div class="container">

<!-- ============ 1. 项目概述 ============ -->
<section>
  <h2><span class="num">01</span>项目概述</h2>
  <p>本项目是一套基于 <strong>ESP32-S3</strong> 微控制器的嵌入式显示控制系统，专为<strong>穿戴康复外骨骼机械手</strong>设计。系统通过 BLE 无线接收肌电传感器/控制器发出的 11 路通道数据，经阈值判断后驱动 6 路舵机 PWM 输出，实现手指的屈伸运动控制。同时提供触摸屏 GUI 界面，支持设备扫描连接、实时数据监控、PWM 输出调节、以及离线手势自主训练等功能。</p>

  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><span class="badge blue">核心功能</span></div>
      <div class="card-desc">BLE 设备扫描与连接、11 通道实时数据接收与显示、6 路 PWM 舵机驱动、急停与单通道暂停控制</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><span class="badge green">训练模式</span></div>
      <div class="card-desc">12 种预设手势图案（数字 1-8/10、OK、点赞、爱心），离线自主训练无需 BLE 连接</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><span class="badge orange">显示规格</span></div>
      <div class="card-desc">SH8601 AMOLED 屏 280×456 像素、FT3168 电容触摸、SPI + I2C 接口</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><span class="badge red">安全机制</span></div>
      <div class="card-desc">全局急停按钮（所有通道强制 1500us 中位）、单通道手动覆盖、优先级分层控制</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>系统定位</h3>
  <p>本显示屏作为外骨骼机械手的<strong>人机交互终端</strong>，承担三大角色：</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>通信枢纽</strong> — 通过 BLE 与上位机/传感器节点建立 GATT 连接，接收实时肌电信号</li>
    <li><strong>控制核心</strong> — 将传感器数据按阈值映射为舵机 PWM 脉宽，驱动 6 路手指运动</li>
    <li><strong>交互界面</strong> — 提供触摸屏 GUI，实时显示数据、PWM 状态，支持手动干预与训练</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<!-- ============ 2. 硬件架构 ============ -->
<section>
  <h2><span class="num">02</span>硬件架构</h2>

  <h3>主控芯片</h3>
  <p>采用 <strong>ESP32-S3</strong> 双核 Xtensa LX7 处理器，集成 2.4GHz Wi-Fi + BLE 5.0 射频，支持 PSRAM。本项目中关闭 Wi-Fi 以避免与 BLE 共享射频造成干扰，专注 BLE 通信。</p>

  <h3>外围器件引脚分配</h3>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>功能模块</th><th>器件</th><th>接口</th><th>GPIO 引脚</th><th>备注</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>AMOLED 显示屏</td><td>SH8601</td><td>SPI (4-wire)</td><td>CS=9, PCLK=10, D0=11, D1=12, D2=13, D3=14</td><td>280×456, 16-bit RGB565</td></tr>
        <tr><td>显示屏复位</td><td>—</td><td>GPIO</td><td>RST=21</td><td>低电平复位</td></tr>
        <tr><td>电容触摸</td><td>FT3168</td><td>I2C</td><td>SDA=47, SCL=48</td><td>地址 0x38</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PWM CH1</td><td><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;">推杆</span>/ESC</td><td>LEDC</td><td>GPIO3</td><td>50Hz / 16bit</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PWM CH2</td><td><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;">推杆</span>/ESC</td><td>LEDC</td><td>GPIO5</td><td>50Hz / 16bit</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PWM CH3</td><td><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;">推杆</span>/ESC</td><td>LEDC</td><td>GPIO6</td><td>50Hz / 16bit</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PWM CH4</td><td><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;">推杆</span>/ESC</td><td>LEDC</td><td>GPIO7</td><td>50Hz / 16bit</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PWM CH5</td><td><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;">推杆</span>/ESC</td><td>LEDC</td><td>GPIO8</td><td>50Hz / 16bit</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PWM CH6</td><td>舵机/ESC</td><td>LEDC</td><td>GPIO2</td><td>由 CH1 派生</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PSRAM</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>GPIO26~32</td><td>已占用，不可复用</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="callout">
    <p><strong>设计说明：</strong>PWM 选用 GPIO 2/3/5/6/7/8 通用 IO 引脚，避开 Flash 引脚（GPIO26~32 PSRAM 占用）和 LCD/Touch 引脚。GPIO3 为 strapping 引脚，上电后可正常作 PWM 输出，仅需保证上电瞬间无强下拉。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 3. 软件架构 ============ -->
<section>
  <h2><span class="num">03</span>软件架构</h2>

  <p>固件基于 <strong>Arduino-ESP32 3.x</strong> 框架开发，使用 FreeRTOS 多任务调度。LVGL v8 负责图形界面渲染，NimBLE 协议栈负责 BLE 通信。</p>

